# EduTrack AI: Adaptive Student Insight System

##  Overview

EduTrack AI is a Java-based CLI application that not only manages student records but also provides **performance insights and risk prediction**.

---

##  Features

*  Add student records (ID, Name, Marks)
*  View all students
*  Search by ID
*  Find topper
*  Calculate average marks
*  Performance classification (High / Average / Needs Attention)
*  Risk prediction (identifies failing students)
*  Persistent storage using file handling

---

##  Tech Stack

* Java
* OOP Concepts
* File Handling (BufferedReader, FileWriter)
* Collections (ArrayList)

---

##  Unique Feature

Unlike traditional systems, EduTrack AI includes a **rule-based analytics engine** that:

* Classifies student performance
* Predicts academic risk
* Simulates real-world intelligent systems

---

##  How to Run

1. Open in Eclipse or any Java IDE
2. Run `Main.java`
3. Use menu options to interact

---

##  Future Enhancements

* GUI using JavaFX
* Database integration (MySQL)
* Advanced analytics using ML

